WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
- You know, Chelsea and I did
a series about gutsy women.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.273
It's called "Gutsy."

00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:08.250
It's going to premiere in
September on AppleTV plus.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.250
And we interviewed women
comics, and we did that in part,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.990
because you know some people still say,

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.260
women can't be funny.
And frankly, I disagree--

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.665
- Oh, Marsha Warfield?

00:00:20.665 --> 00:00:22.072
- --completely! Are you kidding?

00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:23.730
And you know, and we
interviewed Wanda Sykes,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.985
who was telling us--

00:00:24.985 --> 00:00:26.031
- [Kelly] I love her.

00:00:26.031 --> 00:00:27.150
- --who I adore. We interviewed her,

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.760
and she was telling us
about how she'd gone to

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:34.377
a big comedy event that was
to raise money for cancer.

00:00:34.377 --> 00:00:35.250
- [Kelly] For cancer.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.660
- So, I mean, it was a charitable event,

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.000
but she and a bunch of
comics were doing it.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.350
And she was the only woman.

00:00:41.343 --> 00:00:43.020
And they were in Boston, I think.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.960
And she had some jokes about politicians

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.659
who shall remain nameless.
And so she had these jokes,

00:00:49.659 --> 00:00:52.540
half the audience laughed
and half the audience booed

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.370
But the other men who'd been on the stage,

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.620
had also had political jokes.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.958
- Yeah.

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:00.791
- And people either
laughed or they didn't,

00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:02.947
but they didn't boo. And Wanda
was saying like, you know,

00:01:02.947 --> 00:01:06.360
"Here I am, right. I'm out
there. I'm telling these jokes.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.740
And I'm a woman telling these jokes.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.440
And somehow that produces the boo's."

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.360
I thought that was really interesting.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.950
- And for your daughter, that's my thing.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.070
Like for my daughter,
for your kids, your kids,

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.410
like it's, I want a better world.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.131
I don't want women to
have to keep dancing.

00:01:21.131 --> 00:01:22.320
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.546
Like, I don't want to dance around it.

00:01:23.546 --> 00:01:25.849
- You know, the female soccer
team! Female soccer team.

00:01:25.849 --> 00:01:27.253
- [Kelly] You should be able to be bold,

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.336
and courageous, and funny!

00:01:28.336 --> 00:01:29.652
- [Hillary] Yes. They're
much better than our men.

00:01:29.652 --> 00:01:30.485
- I say we get them their money!

00:01:30.485 --> 00:01:31.318
- Yes. Give them their money.

00:01:31.318 --> 00:01:32.226
(audience cheers)

00:01:32.226 --> 00:01:33.059
(Hillary laughs)

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.159
Give them their money!

